# https://www.w3schools.com/python/

These exericises were created based on the W3schools Python tutorials. I have primarily used the above mentioned website to learn Python programming
and used the "PyCharm Community Edition" application to code them. The order of presented coding folders are in the same order I followed the website 
to learn the given concepts. I have added extra comments and details for clarity and better understanding. So install a Python app you want and 
download the codes to your machine and follow along for fastest way to learn python.

Please follow along on the order of folders given below.
- Introduction to Python
- File Handling







You can download PyCharm Community Edition from JetBrains using below link :
https://www.jetbrains.com/pycharm/download/?section=windows
